<VI _name="lvdqmh_splice_module_data.vi" description="lvai_dqmh_place_handler's module-data step\3A puts a DQMH message handler that is already in its frame IN SERIES into the frame's module-data wire. Main.vi is opened through Project\3AActive Project. The frame is found by its case selector name among every Case Structure (as lvdqmh_place_frame_handler finds it)\3B the handler is the frame's first subVI\3B its In Name / Out Name terminals are found by name. The module-data pair is the only wire of the frame that runs straight from an inner SOURCE tunnel terminal to an inner SINK tunnel terminal (terminals matched by Position)\3A the source (Is Source? true) and the sink. With Dry Run FALSE and exactly one of each\2C the source's connected wire is deleted\2C the source is wired to the handler's In Name\2C the handler's Out Name to the sink\2C and Main.vi is saved.\0A\0AWritten and measured by the user in session 7 (2026-11-03) as s7_splice_module_data_v3 and shipped here unchanged but for its uids\2C raised by 4100 into the safe range. Matching the module-data tunnels by {LV.Terminal} Type Descriptor did NOT work there\3A the handler's terminal read 38 words and the tunnel 37 - the descriptor carries the terminal's label - so source and sink are paired by Position.">

